/F2 13 Tf (4. Operations phases) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
T*
(Launch and early orbit operations last three days and end once the solar wings are) Tj T*
(deployed and two-way contact is stable. Commissioning takes six weeks, after which) Tj T*
(routine operations are planned to continue for three years.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf (5. End of life) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
T*
(At the end of the mission a deployable drag sail called the Furl, 1.5 square metres in) Tj T*
(area, will be released to increase atmospheric drag. Re-entry is expected within five) Tj T*
(years of deployment. Before the sail opens the spacecraft is passivated: the battery is) Tj T*
(discharged and both transmitters are switched off.) Tj T*
T*
ET
